| Unemployment | 3.2% (165,900), down from 3.4% | DOSM [primary] |
| Skill-related underemployment | 32.2%; 1.60 million "employed below their qualifications", count up 3.9%. Series: 29.5% (2020), 33.8%, 34.2%, 32.4%, 32.2% | DOSM [primary] |
| By age | 66.0% under 25; 18.6% at 45 and above | DOSM [primary] |
| Occupations | 67.8% skilled; 31.0% semi-skilled; 1.2% low-skilled, the last up 11.0% | DOSM [primary] |
