| Comparators in the same release (ILOSTAT) | Brunei 18.1%, US 27.3%, Australia 27.5%, UK 28.5%, Malaysia 32.2%, South Korea 36.8%, Indonesia 42.2%, Philippines 56.7%, Myanmar 64.4% | DOSM [primary] |
| Overqualified | 48.6% of graduates in 2021 (peak 57.3% in 2018); 65.6% started below RM2,000 | KRI Shifting Tides 2024, with MOHE, via Malay Mail [secondary] |
